    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Story Behind the Song: A Women in Music Songwriter’s Circle\n\nPresented as part of Capital Music Week and hosted by Canadian rock icon Bif Naked, Story Behind the Song brings together Kellylee Evans, Jessica Pearson, Emma Lamontagne and Vaan Thibz for an intimate songwriter’s circle exploring the stories and experiences behind their music.\n\nHear the songs stripped back, discover what inspired them and get a rare look inside the creative process of some incredible women making music today.\n\nPresented by National Arts Centre..."
      }
