      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us outside on the National Arts Centre terrace to experience Natural Nights Ottawa through a free introductory night sky observation led by astronomers from RASC Ottawa. Weather and sky conditions permitting, participants will have the opportunity to observe Saturn through a telescope while learning how astronomers interpret the night sky from an urban environment.\n\nPlease note: If conditions are not optimal on Oct. 7, the ‘raincheque’ event will take place on Thursday, Oct. 8."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns/fb#admins": [
