    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join the Ballet Mexicain du Montreal in a bold and contemporary celebration of Mexican culture, where the spirit of the carpa meets the glamour of cabaret and the timeless tradition of Día de Muertos.\n\nStep into a vibrant and mysterious world where tradition, fantasy and spectacle come together. Inspired by the legendary Mexican cabarets and carpas—the popular tent theatres that once brought music, comedy, dance and irreverent entertainment to audiences across Mexico—and rooted in the rich traditions of Día de Muertos,..."
      }
    ],
