    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Beaded Gauntlet Mitt Workshop with Colleen Nolan offers a unique opportunity to learn the traditional art of crafting your own pair of beautifully warm, handmade gauntlet mitts.\nParticipants will enjoy hands-on guidance through each step of the process—from selecting materials to sewing and finishing—with optional beadwork to personalize your creation. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced crafter, all are welcome.\nThis workshop is more than just crafting; it’s about sharing stories, laughter, and cultural connection in a supportive, community-focused environment...."
      }
